| planner, increment | `complete` · `final` · `intermediate` | — | `round=close` or `open` |
| planner, respond | `dispositioned` · `delta-complete` · `delta-remaining` | — | — |
| {{ worker }} | `done` + commit | `replan` · `respawn` | — |
{% else %}
| implementer, incremental | `done` · `in-progress`, + commit | — | `tree=clean` or `dirty` |
| implementer, respond | `responded` · `delta-complete` · `delta-remaining`, + commit | — | `tree=clean` |
{% endif %}
| designer, triage | `resume` · `delta` | — | — |
| designer, other modes | `written` | — | — |
| reviewers | `findings` · `no-findings` | — | — |
| judge | `approved` · `rework` | — | — |
{% if sweep %}
