{% if fg_design %}
**Forester gate**, mode design, id `r<R>-g<G>`: + the document path, + this
review's notes, dispositions and verdict paths, + any escalation verdict.
{% if decide %}
`approve` → the gate clears; `G` = 1. `notes` → bump design `R`; `designer`
**respond** with the userproxy notes as its notes path → `judge`{% if eli5 %} → fresh
rendering if the design changed{% endif %}; `G` += 1; forester gate again. The
escalation verdict, if any, is answered this way too. Judge `approved` is
not forester approval. Should the user intervene in chat regardless, their
