   document, or chat directives verbatim to a fresh notes file). Every
   change request, whatever it asks for, goes to `designer` **delta** mode
   (**Spec deltas**); you do not classify it. The delta lands in a new
   round: round base = current HEAD, `I` = 0, bump implementation `R`.
{% if forester %}
5. After the squash{% if autopush %} and push, if any{% endif %}: **Report**.
{% endif %}
{% if forester %}6{% else %}5{% endif %}. **Artifact commit** — the **Stop commit** of the shipped end, when the
   artifact repo is not the repo: after the squash{% if changelog %}, the changelog{% endif %}, any push
   already made{% if forester %} and the report{% endif %}, the last action before the cycle's closing
   stop. A push touches no artifact; a post-cycle push commits nothing.
{% if forester %}7{% else %}6{% endif %}. STOP: surface {% if forester %}the report path and {% endif %}the branch and HEAD as a
   fact — `<branch> at <HEAD>, pushed to origin` or `<branch> at <HEAD>,
